section.para:
The following settings are active as soon as a &minimalvm; image boots. They describe the
state of the system as shipped. For how &minimalvm; differs from an installed &productname;
system, see .

listitem.para:
When using &jeosfirstboot;, the wizard prompts you to set a local &rootuser;
password, create a standard user account, and enroll SSH public keys for remote
access.
